0007:     """
0008:     Complete straight horizontal and vertical connectors between same-color marker pixels that already share a row or column.
0009: 
0010:     Input structure
0011:     - A mostly background grid containing isolated foreground marker pixels of one color.
0012: 
0013:     Rule
0014:     - For every row containing at least two original foreground pixels, color the full span from the leftmost to rightmost such pixel.
0015:     - For every column containing at least two original foreground pixels, color the full span from the topmost to bottommost such pixel.
0016:     - Leave all other cells unchanged.
0017: 
0018:     Key insight
0019:     - The markers define all orthogonal line segments by row/column alignment; spans are computed from the input markers, not from newly drawn pixels.
0020:     """
